{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forEach","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"R1","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W1","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"writing","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, (","kind":"text"},{"text":"R1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS6FamilyV7forEach7reading7writing_yqd__m_qd_0_myqd___qd_0_ztKXEtKAA9ComponentRd__AaGRd_0_r0_lF","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","title":"forEach(reading:writing:_:)","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"each C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Iterates the members of this family, reading some of their components and changing others in place.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forEach","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"R1","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W1","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rType1","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"writing","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"wType1","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"R1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"rType1","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component type to read."}]}]},{"name":"wType1","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component type to change in place."}]}]},{"name":"body","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Called once per member."}]}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" receives the read components first (as copies), then the written ones as "},{"code":"inout","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The writes land"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the component storage directly. Overloads exist for 0 to 4 read and 0 to 4 written component types, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter pack overload covers more. Every fixed arity overload resolves the typed storages once and then runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a plain loop over the members: no allocation and no dynamic dispatch per member."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let movers = nexus.family(requiresAll: Position.self, Velocity.self)","movers.forEach(reading: Velocity.self, writing: Position.self) { velocity, position in","    position.x += velocity.dx","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Access is declared like the "},{"code":"in","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"inout","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" term modifiers of flecs queries"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(“Access modifiers” in "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/SanderMertens\/flecs\/blob\/master\/docs\/Queries.md","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), whose "},{"code":"each","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" callbacks take "},{"code":"const T&","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for reads and "},{"code":"T&","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for writes: here the labels "},{"code":"reading:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"writing:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" state it."}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every read and written type must be a required component of this family, not an excluded one."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The written types must be pairwise different and different from the read types, and a pass must not nest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a write access to a type that an enclosing pass or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modify"},{"type":"text","text":" writes. Violations trap."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" runs, structural changes trap: creating or destroying entities, adding or removing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components, and replacing a component with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"set"},{"type":"text","text":". Collect them and apply them after the pass, and write"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changed values through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout"},{"type":"text","text":" parameters. Reading a written type through the nexus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(for example "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entity.get(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":") traps, too."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Members are visited once each. The sparse-set storage visits them in the order of the family’s member list, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"archetype storage table by table and row by row; neither order is a contract, and structural changes reorder them."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the delegate subscribed to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/valueChanges","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" event per written type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is delivered after the pass, not one per member. If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" throws, the pass ends there, members already visited,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"including the one that threw, stay changed and the events cover them."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"style":"note","name":"Complexity","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(N) where N is the number of members, plus one hash lookup per component type."}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/family\/foreach(reading:writing:_:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEach(reading:writing:_:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family"]]},"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/NexusEventMask/valueChanges":{"abstract":[{"text":"Changes of component values: ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentReplaced","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentModified","isActive":true},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"t